        ecrm:P3_has_note    "A silk woven, striped and patterned fabric. The ground is a 5 end satin, 3 shift. The pattern is created with lisere effects of the ground weft. The design is of a red stork and red floral icons. The ground warp binds the pattern on the front in a 1:4 twill, Z direction, double warps. The fragment has selvedge on one side, a small brown stain on the front and what may be a brown stamp (with characters) on the back.\n\nWarp\n1)\tground\n\tsilk, 1-ply, slight S\n\tred, purple, white, light and dark green\n\tapp. 100 ends cm\n\nWeft\n1)\tground \n\tsilk, 5 or 6-ply, STA\n\tred\n\tapp. 32 picks cm"@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/8ae564f4-3725-310e-b5a1-4b06b2a14db7> .

